Feature: Approvals offers Ambulance as a hold for that ticket

  # BL-893 approvals-ambulance-button-01
  Scenario: Tapping Ambulance engages hold and does not approve
    Given an Approvals ask for a live ticket whose human_approval is pending
    When the human taps Ambulance on that ask
    Then ambulance is engaged for that ticket via the existing Control marker
    And the ticket's human_approval is still pending
    And a receipt naming the ticket is posted in Approvals

  # BL-893 approvals-ambulance-slash-02
  Scenario: /ambulance in Approvals is the same engage as the button
    Given the Approvals topic
    When the human sends "/ambulance BL-xxx" naming a ticket that exists under backlog/
    Then ambulance is engaged for that ticket via the existing Control marker
    And human_approval is not flipped by this command

  # BL-893 approvals-ambulance-unknown-id-03
  Scenario: A missing id is refused and does not engage
    Given the Approvals topic
    When the human sends "/ambulance BL-99999" naming no YAML under backlog/
    Then ambulance is not engaged
    And the refusal is posted in Approvals

  # BL-893 approvals-ambulance-not-qjump-04
  Scenario: Ambulance is not Q jump and not the expeditor
    Given an Approvals ask
    When the human taps Ambulance
    Then the ticket is not force-promoted
    And no build is dispatched
    And the offline expeditor is not started
